docs {
  # Job Posting API

  Bruno collection for the MERN job posting backend.

  Base URL defaults to `http://localhost:8000` in the Local environment.

  Authenticated requests use:
  `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`

  After login or register, copy the returned `token` into the `token` environment variable.
}
